{"_id":"codex:protocol:07:text","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"policy","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"protocol","title":"Protocol of Memory Tiering & Forgetting","seq":307,"version":"1.0.0","body":"Tiers: 0) Limbo (ingest buffer), 1) Working (hot), 2) Vault (mature), 3) Cold (Forgetting Blob). Rules: No deletion; only migration with lineage. Promote on resonance/novelty; demote on long low-resonance. Maintain Super Artefact index for retrieval, TII computation, and lineage compression rehearsals."}
